### Kevalon ERP — Module 13: Ledger
@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000/api
@token = REPLACE_WITH_ACCESS_TOKEN
@companyId = REPLACE_WITH_COMPANY_ID
@accountId = REPLACE_WITH_ACCOUNT_ID
@financialYearId = REPLACE_WITH_FINANCIAL_YEAR_ID

### Account ledger history
GET {{baseUrl}}/ledger/{{accountId}}?companyId={{companyId}}&financialYearId={{financialYearId}}&from=2025-04-01&to=2026-03-31
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Current account balance
GET {{baseUrl}}/ledger/{{accountId}}/balance?companyId={{companyId}}&financialYearId={{financialYearId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
